```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  actor Pengguna
  participant App as apps/app
  participant Web as apps/web
  participant API as apps/api
  participant SB as Supabase
  participant Q as Queue/Redis

  rect rgb(240,240,255)
  note over Admin,SB: 1) Manajemen Tugas & Proyek
  Admin->>SB: INSERT proyek/tugas
  App->>API: POST /runs (tenant)
  API-->>App: 201 {runId}
  App->>API: SSE subscribe /runs/{runId}/events
  API-->>App: stream events
  Pengguna->>API: POST /runs/{runId}/continue
  Pengguna->>API: POST /runs/{runId}/cancel
  end

  rect rgb(240,255,240)
  note over Pengguna,SB: 2) Analisis Data Bisnis
  Pengguna->>App: Ajukan pertanyaan
  App->>API: POST /runs (pipeline)
  API-->>App: stream insight
  Pengguna->>SB: Save insight to doc
  end

  rect rgb(255,240,240)
  note over Admin,Q: 3) Otomatisasi Proses Bisnis
  Admin->>API: Define workflow & trigger
  API->>Q: Enqueue jobs
  API-->>Web: Stream status
  end

  rect rgb(255,255,240)
  note over Admin,API: 4) Integrasi Eksternal
  Admin->>API: Register connector & creds
  API-->>Admin: Test connection OK
  Web->>API: Use connector in run
  end

  rect rgb(240,255,255)
  note over Pengguna,Web: 5) Smart Document Engine
  Pengguna->>Web: Create document
  Web->>SB: CRUD documents
  App->>API: POST /tools/render
  API-->>App: {url, commitId}
  end
```
